Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Enable accessibility tree in headless mode

Forces accessibility to be enabled in headless mode and exposes
the BrowserAccessibilityManager to the abrowser bridge.

This patch:
1. Forces --force-renderer-accessibility in headless mode
2. Adds a method to extract accessibility tree snapshots
3. Hooks accessibility updates to send to the Rust renderer
